<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles/_house.css">
<style>
.root { gap: 28px; }
.flowstrip { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 14px; }
.card.code .d { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--code); }
.card.code { background: var(--elevated); }
.cardlogo { height: 24px; opacity: 0.85; margin-left: 12px; }
</style>
<style>@page { size: 900,00pt 336,75pt; margin: 0 }</style></head>
<body>


<div class="col root"><div class="row"><div class="card blue"><div class="t">AI Application Layer</div><div class="d">Prompt &amp; Response Text</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">Operating System</div><div class="d">open() read() connect() execve()</div></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="card"><div class="t">WAF / Network Firewall</div><div class="d">Sees TLS packets, never the prompt</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">Guardrails / LLM Guard</div><div class="d">Sees text, never the syscalls</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">gVisor / Tetragon / Falco</div><div class="d">Sees syscalls, never the intent</div></div></div>
<div class="card red"><div class="t">⚡ eBPF Boundary Tracing</div><div class="d">Correlates BOTH views simultaneously in real-time</div></div></div>
<div class="flowstrip"><div>⚡ eBPF Boundary Tracing &#8594; AI Application Layer</div>
<div>⚡ eBPF Boundary Tracing &#8594; Operating System</div></div>

</body>
</html>
